From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:14:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix: mark a space dropped last under the last box

The drop marker for the slot after the last space sat on the row right
under that space's name, which is now its first tree line. Record where
each space's tree ends and put the marker there, on the box's bottom
edge.

diff --git a/src/client/shell/endpoint_sidebar.rs b/src/client/shell/endpoint_sidebar.rs
